<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Biblica® Open Ewe Contemporary Scriptures 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekaria ƒe agbalẽ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zek</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="mt2">ƒe agbalẽ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nuxɔxlɔ̃ amewo be woatrɔ ɖe Yehowa ŋu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1"/>Le ɣleti enyilia me le Fia Darius ƒe ƒe evelia me la, gbe tso Yehowa gbɔ va na Nyagblɔɖila Zekaria, Berekia ƒe vi kple Ido ƒe tɔgbuiyɔvi be,<verse eid="ZEC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2"/>“Yehowa do dɔmedzoe ɖe mia fofowo ŋu vevie, <verse eid="ZEC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3"/>eya ta gblɔ na ameawo be ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, ‘Mitrɔ ɖe ŋunye, ekema nye hã matrɔ ɖe mia ŋu!’ <verse eid="ZEC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4"/>Miganɔ abe mia fofowo ene o, ame siwo nyagblɔɖila tsãtɔwo gblɔ na be ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: ‘Mitrɔ le miaƒe mɔ vɔ̃wo dzi, eye miaɖe asi le miaƒe nu vɔ̃ɖi wɔwɔwo ŋuti.’ Gake wogbe toɖoɖom, eye wometsɔ ɖeke le eme nam o. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5"/>Afi ka mia fofowo le fifia, eye ɖe nyagblɔɖilawo nɔa agbe tegbea? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6"/>Ke ɖe nye nya kple ɖoɖo siwo mede asi na nye dɔla, nyagblɔɖilawo la meva mia fofowo dzi oa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">“Le esia ta la, wotrɔ dzi me gblɔ be, ‘Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la wɔ na mí ɖe míaƒe mɔwo kple wɔnawo nu abe ale si wòɖoe be yeawɔ ene.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɔdola si le amitiwo dome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7"/>Le ɣleti wuiɖekɛlia si nye Sebat ƒe ŋkeke blaeve-vɔ-enelia dzi, le Fia Darius ƒe ƒe evelia me la, Yehowa ƒe gbe va na nyagblɔɖila Zekaria, Berekia ƒe vi kple Ido ƒe tɔgbuiyɔvi.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8"/>Mekpɔ ŋutega le zã me, eye le ŋutega la me la, mekpɔ ŋutsu aɖe wònɔ sɔ dzĩ aɖe dom. Sɔdola la tsi tsitre ɖe amitive aɖe me le bali aɖe me. Sɔ dzĩ, sɔ hẽ kple sɔ ɣi bubuwo nɔ emegbe.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9"/>Mebia be, “Nye Aƒetɔ, nu kawoe nye esiawo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Mawudɔla si nɔ nu ƒom kplim la ɖo eŋu nam be, “Mafia nu si wonye la wò.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10"/>Tete ame si tsi tsitre ɖe amitiawo dome la ɖe eme nam be, “Woawoe nye ame siwo Yehowa dɔ be woatsa le anyigba blibo la dzi.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11"/>Wova gblɔ na Yehowa ƒe dɔla, ame si nɔ tsitre ɖe amitiawo dome la be, “Míetsa le anyigba blibo la dzi, eye dzidzedze kple ŋutifafa le afi sia afi.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12"/>Esi Yehowa ƒe dɔla la se nya siawo la, edo gbe ɖa be, “O Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ, ƒe blaadree nye esi, esi nètrɔ wò dɔmedzoe kɔ ɖe Yerusalem kple Yuda ƒe duwo dzi. Va se ɖe ɣe ka ɣi nàgakpɔ nublanui na wo?” <verse eid="ZEC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13"/>Yehowa ɖo eŋu na mawudɔla si le xanye la hegblɔ akɔfanyawo kple dzideƒonyawo nɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14"/>Tete mawudɔla si nɔ nu ƒom kplim la gblɔ be, “Ɖe gbeƒã nya sia: ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: ‘Meʋã ŋu ɖe Yerusalem kple Zion nu ŋutɔ, <verse eid="ZEC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15"/>ke mekpɔ dɔmedzoe vevie ɖe dukɔ siwo susu be yewole dedie la ŋuti. Ke dɔmedzoe vi aɖe ko mekpɔ, gake woawoe he dzɔgbevɔ̃e la vɛ.’<verse eid="ZEC 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16"/>“Eya ta ale Yehowa gblɔe nye esi: ‘Matrɔ ɖe Yerusalem ŋu kple nublanuikpɔkpɔ. Le afi ma, woagbugbɔ nye xɔ la atu, eye woatsɔ nudzidzeka aɖo Yerusalem katã ŋuti.’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17"/>“Yi edzi, nàɖe gbeƒã be ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, ‘Nye duwo agagbagba kple dzidzedze, Yehowa agafa akɔ na Zion, eye wòagatia Yerusalem.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lãdzo eneawo kple aɖaŋudɔwɔla eneawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18"/>Esi mefɔ kɔ dzi la, mekpɔ lãdzo ene le nye ŋkume. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19"/>Mebia mawudɔla la be “Nu kawoe nye esiawo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Eɖo eŋu nam be, “Woawoe nye lãdzo siwo kaka Yuda, Israel kple Yerusalem.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20"/>Yehowa gaɖe gbede ene fiam. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21"/>Mebia be, “Nu ka wɔ ge wogbɔna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">Eɖo eŋu nam be, “Esiawoe nye lãdzo siwo kaka Yuda ale gbegbe be ame aɖeke mate ŋu afɔ ta dzi o. Ke gbedeawo va be woado ŋɔdzi na wo, eye woatsɔ dukɔwo ƒe lãdzo siawo aƒu ame siwo kɔ woƒe dzowo dzi ɖe Yudanyigba ŋu be yewoakaka eƒe amewo la anyi.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ŋutsu si lé dzidzeka ɖe asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1"/>Esi mefɔ kɔ dzi la, mekpɔ ŋutsu aɖe wòlé nudzidzeka ɖe asi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2"/>Mebiae be, “Afi ka yim nèle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">Eɖo eŋu be, “Meyina be madzidze Yerusalem, ne makpɔ eƒe kekeme kple eƒe didime.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3"/>Mawudɔla si nɔ nu ƒom kplim la dzo le gbɔnye, eye mawudɔla bubu zɔ va kpee. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4"/>Mawudɔla si zɔ va kpee la gblɔ nɛ be, “Ƒu du nàgblɔ na ɖekakpui sia be, ŋkeke li gbɔna esi amewo ayɔ Yerusalem ale gbegbe be womakpɔ nɔƒe na ame sia ame kple woƒe lãhawo o. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5"/>Nye ŋutɔ manye dzo bibi ƒe gli aƒo xlã wo, eye manye eƒe ŋutikɔkɔe.” Yehowae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6"/>“ ‘Miva! Miva! Misi tso anyiehenyigba dzi,’ Yehowae gblɔe, elabena mekaka mi de dziƒowo ƒe ya eneawo katã dzi!” Yehowae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7"/>“Va, O Zion! Si, wò ame si li kple Babilon vinyɔnu!” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8"/>Elabena ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, “Esi wòde bubu ŋutinye, eye wòdɔm ɖe dukɔ siwo ha mi ŋuti, elabena ame si ka asi mia ŋuti la, ka asi eƒe gadaglamakui ŋuti. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9"/>Nye la, makɔ nye asi dzi ɖe wo ŋuti kokoko, ale woƒe kluviwo aha wo. Ekema mianyae be Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae dɔm.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10"/>“O, Zion vinyɔnu, tso aseye nàkpɔ dzidzɔ, elabena megbɔna be manɔ dowòme.” Yehowae gblɔe. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11"/>“Dukɔ geɖewo ava ƒo ƒu ɖe Yehowa ŋu gbe ma gbe, eye woanye nye amewo. Manɔ mia dome eye mianya be Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae dɔm ɖe mia gbɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12"/>Yuda azu Yehowa ƒe gome kple domenyinu le anyigba kɔkɔe la dzi, eye wòagatia Yerusalem. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13"/>Mi anyigbadzitɔwo katã mizi ɖoɖoe le Yehowa ŋkume, elabena etso le eƒe nɔƒe kɔkɔe la.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Awu dzadzɛwo na nunɔlagã la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1"/>Le ŋutega bubu me la, Yehowa ɖe Yosua, nunɔlagã la fiam, wònɔ tsitre ɖe Yehowa ƒe dɔla la gbɔ, evɔ Satana hã nɔ afi ma nɔ tsitre ɖe mawudɔla la ƒe nuɖusime nɔ Yosua nu tsom. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2"/>Yehowa gblɔ na Satana be, “Yehowa ka mo na wò, Satana! Yehowa, ame si tia Yerusalem la ka mo na wò! Ɖe ame sia mele abe dzoti bibi si woɖe le dzo me la ene oa?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3"/>Azɔ Yosua le awu ƒoɖiwo me le tsitre ɖe mawudɔla la gbɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4"/>Mawudɔla la gblɔ na ame siwo nɔ tsitre ɖe afi ma la be, “Miɖe awu ƒoɖi sia le eŋuti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 3:4">Etrɔ ɖe Yosua gbɔ gblɔ nɛ be, “Kpɔ ɖa, meɖe wò nu vɔ̃wo ɖa, eye azɔ la, mele awu yeye nyui siawo dom na wò.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5"/>Tete megblɔ be, “Mitsɔ tablanu dzadzɛ bla ta nɛ.” Ale wotsɔ tablanu dzadzɛ bla ta nɛ, eye wotsɔ awu do nɛ esi Yehowa ƒe dɔla la nɔ tsitre.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6"/>Yehowa ƒe dɔla la de se sia na Yosua, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7"/>“Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: ‘Ne àzɔ le nye mɔwo dzi, alé nye ɖoɖowo me ɖe asi la, ekema maɖo wò nye gbedoxɔ nu, ànye nye aƒedzikpɔla, eye mana nɔƒe wò ɖe ame siwo le tsitre ɖe afi sia la dome.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8"/>“ ‘Miɖo to, O nunɔlagã Yosua kple wò kpeɖeŋutɔ siwo nɔ anyi ɖe ŋgɔwò, ame siwo nye nu siwo ava va eme la ƒe dzesi. Meyi makplɔ nye dɔla Atilɔ la vɛ. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9"/>Kpɔ kpe si metsɔ ɖo Yosua ŋkume la ɖa! Ŋku adre li na kpe ɖeka sia. Maŋlɔ nu ɖe kpe la dzi, eye maɖe anyigba sia ƒe nu vɔ̃ ɖa le ŋkeke ɖeka me,’ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10"/>“ ‘Gbe ma gbe la, mia dometɔ ɖe sia ɖe akpe ehavi be wòava nɔ eƒe wainka kple gboti te.’ Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Sikakaɖiti la kple amiti eveawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1"/>Mawudɔla si ƒo nu kplim la, trɔ gbɔ va nyɔm abe ɖe menɔ alɔ̃ dɔm ene. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2"/>Ebiam be, “Azɔ la, nu ka kpɔm nèle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Meɖo eŋu be, “Mele sikakaɖiti si dzi wotsɔ agba da ɖo, eye akaɖi adre le agba sia tame, alɔ adre siwo me do le la to akaɖiti ɖe sia ɖe me ge ɖe agba la me. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3"/>Amiti eve le axawo dzi nɛ; ɖeka le ɖusime, evelia le miame.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4"/>Mebia mawudɔla si ƒo nu kplim la be, “Nu kawoe nye esiawo, nye aƒetɔ?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5"/>Mawudɔla la trɔ biam be, “Vavã, mènya nu si nu siawo nye oa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Meɖo eŋu be, “Ao, nye Aƒetɔ.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6"/>Egblɔ nam be, “Esia nye Yehowa ƒe gbedeasi na Zerubabel: ‘Menye ŋusẽ alo kalẽ o, ke boŋ Mawu ƒe Gbɔgbɔe.’ Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7"/>“Nu ka nènye, O, to si ŋu ŋusẽ le? Àzu anyigba sɔsɔe le Zerubabel ŋkume, ahe tamekpe la ado goe ne ɣli le ɖiɖim be, ‘Mawu neyrae! Mawu neyrae!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8"/>Tete Yehowa ƒe gbe va nam be, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9"/>“Zerubabel ƒe asie ɖo gbedoxɔ sia ƒe gɔmeɖokpe anyi, eya ta eƒe asie awu enu. Ekema mianya be Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae dɔm ɖe mia gbɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10"/>“Ame ka ado vlo ŋkeke si nuwo dze egɔme sue? Dzi adzɔ amewo, ne wokpɔ dzidzeka le Zerubabel ƒe asi me. Akaɖi adre siawoe nye Yehowa ƒe ŋku siwo wòtsɔna tsana le anyigba katã dzii.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11"/>Mebia mawudɔla la be, “Nu kae nye amiti eve siwo le ɖusime kple miame na akaɖiti la?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12"/>Megabia be, “Nu kawoe nye amiti ƒe alɔdze eve siwo le sika ƒe alɔ siwo me sikami dona tsona?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13"/>Eɖo eŋu be, “Mènya nu si wonye oa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Megblɔ be, “Ao, nye aƒetɔ.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14"/>Ale wògblɔ nam be, “Woawoe nye ame eve siwo wosi ami na be woasubɔ anyigba blibo la ƒe Aƒetɔ.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Agbalẽ si le dzodzom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1"/>Megawu mo dzi eye mekpɔ agbalẽ aɖe wònɔ dzodzom le yame.<verse eid="ZEC 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2"/>Mawudɔla la biam be, “Nu ka nèkpɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Meɖo eŋu be, “Mekpɔ agbalẽ aɖe si le dzodzom! Agbalẽ la ƒe didime nye afɔ blaetɔ̃ eye eƒe kekeme nye afɔ wuiatɔ̃.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3"/>Eye wògblɔ nam be, “Agbalẽ siae nye fiƒode si le tsatsam le anyigba la katã dzi. Agbalẽ la ƒe akpa ɖeka le gbɔgblɔm be woaɖe fiafitɔ ɖe sia ɖe ɖa, eye akpa evelia le gbɔgblɔm be, ame sia ame si kaa atam dzodzro la, woaɖee ɖa. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4"/>Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔ be, ‘Madɔ fiƒode sia ɖa, eye age ɖe fiafitɔ la ƒe aƒe me kple ame si yɔa nye ŋkɔ tsɔ kaa atam dzodzro la ƒe aƒe me. Anɔ eƒe aƒe me, agbã aƒe nɛ, eye wòakaka atiawo kple kpeawo siaa.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɔnu si le kusi me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5"/>Mawudɔla si nɔ nu ƒom kplim la zɔ va gbɔnye, eye wògblɔ nam be, “Fɔ mo dzi nàkpɔ nu si le yame gbɔna.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6"/>Mebiae be, “Nu ka wònye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Eɖo eŋu be, “Nudzidzekusie” Egagblɔ kpe ɖe eŋu be, “Esiae nye amewo ƒe nu vɔ̃ le anyigba katã la dzi.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7"/>Kasia nutunu gã si le kusi la nu la fɔ dzi, eye mekpɔ nyɔnu aɖe si nɔ anyi ɖe kusi la me! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8"/>Mawudɔla la gblɔ be, “Esiae nye vɔ̃ɖinyenye,” eye wotutui gade kusi la me hetsɔ nutunu gã la tu enu.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9"/>Azɔ mekpɔ nyɔnu eve siwo dzo gbɔna ɖe gbɔnye, woƒe aʋalawo le abe damixetɔwo ene, eye wova kɔ kusi gã la hedzo kplii yi ɖe dziƒo ʋĩi.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10"/>Mebia mawudɔla si nɔ nu ƒom kplim la be, “Afi ka wokɔ kusi la yinae?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11"/>Eɖo eŋu nam be, “Wokɔe yina ɖe Babilonia, afi si woatu xɔ ɖo nɛ. Ne wotu xɔ la nɛ vɔ la, woakɔ kusi la ada ɖe enɔƒe le afi ma.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Tasiaɖam eneawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1"/>Megafɔ kɔ dzi, eye mekpɔ tasiaɖam ene wogbɔna tso to eve dome; to siawo le abe akɔbliga ene. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2"/>Sɔ dzĩwo le tasiaɖam gbãtɔ hem, eye sɔ yibɔwo le tasiaɖam evelia hem. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3"/>Sɔ ɣiwo le tasiaɖam etɔ̃lia hem, eye sɔ ŋɔŋɔewo le tasiaɖam enelia hem kple ŋusẽ. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4"/>Mebia mawudɔla si nɔ nu ƒom kplim la be, “Nye Aƒetɔ, nu kawoe nye esiawo?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5"/>Eɖo eŋu nam be, “Woawoe nye gbɔgbɔ ene siwo tso dziƒo, wonɔa anyigba la ƒe Aƒetɔ ŋkume ɖaa; ke azɔ la, edɔ wo ɖe dɔgbe. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6"/>Tasiaɖam si ŋuti sɔ yibɔwo le la aɖo ta dukɔ si le anyiehe, esi ŋuti sɔ ɣiwo le la ayi ɣetoɖoƒe, eye esi ŋuti wotsi sɔ ŋɔŋɔewo ɖo la ayi dziehe.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7"/>Esi sɔ sesẽawo do go la, wodze agbagba be woatsa le anyigba blibo la dzi. Egblɔ be, “Miyi miatsa le anyigba la katã dzi.” Ale woyi ɖatsa le anyigba blibo la dzi.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8"/>Mawudɔla la yɔm gblɔ nam be, “Kpɔ ɖa, esiwo yi anyiehenyigba dzi la, wotsi nye dɔmedzoe nu le anyiehenyigba la dzi.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fiakuku na Yosua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9"/>Yehowa ƒe gbe va nam be, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10"/>“Xɔ klosalo kple sika le Heldai, Tobiya kple Yedaia, ame siwo gbɔ tso aboyome le Babilonia la si. Yi ɖe Zefania, Yosia ƒe vi hã ƒe aƒe me gbe ma gbe ke. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11"/>Tsɔ klosalo kple sika la nàwɔ fiakuku, eye nàtsɔe aɖɔ na nunɔlagã Yosua, Yehozadak ƒe vi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12"/>Gblɔ nɛ be ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi. Esiae nye ŋutsu si ƒe ŋkɔe nye Atilɔ, adze tso enɔƒe, eye wòatu Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13"/>Eyae nye ame si atu Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ, woaɖo fianyenye ƒe atsyɔ̃ nɛ, eye wòanɔ eƒe fiazikpui dzi aɖu fia. Anye nunɔla anɔ eƒe fiazikpui dzi, ekema fianyenye kple nunɔlanyenye awɔ ɖeka! <verse eid="ZEC 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14"/>Woatsɔ fiakuku la na Heldai, Tobiya Yedaia kple Hen, Zefania ƒe vi, abe ŋkuɖodzinu ene le Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ me. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15"/>Ame siwo le didiƒe ke la ava, akpe asi ɖe Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ la tutu ŋu, ekema mianyae be Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae dɔm ɖe mia gbɔ. Esia ava eme nenye be mieɖo to Yehowa, miaƒe Mawu la ƒe gbe pɛpɛpɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Dzɔdzɔenyenye kple nublanuikpɔkpɔ menye gotagome nutsitsidɔ o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1"/>Le Fia Darius ƒe ƒe enelia me, le dzinu asiekɛlia si nye Kislev ƒe ŋkeke enea gbe la, Yehowa ƒe gbe va na Zekaria. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2"/>Ame siwo le Betel la dɔ Sarezer, Regen Melek kple wo ŋutimewo be woaɖe kuku na Yehowa <verse eid="ZEC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3"/>to nunɔlawo kple nyagblɔɖila siwo le Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la ƒe gbedoxɔ me la dzi be, “Ɖe wòhiã be mafa avi, atsi nu adɔ le ɣleti atɔ̃lia me abe ale si mewɔnɛ ƒe geɖe siwo va yi la enea?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4"/>Tete Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la ƒe gbe va nam be, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5"/>“Bia ame siwo katã le anyigba la dzi kple Osɔfoawo be, ‘Esi mietsi nu dɔ, fa avi le ɣleti atɔ̃lia kple adrelia me le ƒe blaadre siwo va yi me la, nyee mietsi nua dɔ na vavã? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6"/>Esi mienɔ nu ɖum, nɔ nu nom la, ɖe menye na miawo ŋutɔ ƒe dzidzɔkpɔkpɔ koe oa? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7"/>Ɖe menye nya siawoe Yehowa gblɔ to nyagblɔɖila siwo do ŋgɔ la dzi, esi Yerusalem kple du siwo ƒo xlãe godoo la nɔ ŋutifafa kple dzidzedzekpɔkpɔ me, eye gbegbe kple ɣetoɖoƒetogbɛwo zu amenɔƒe oa?’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8"/>Yehowa ƒe gbe gava na Zekaria be, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9"/>“Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: ‘Midrɔ̃ ʋɔnu dzɔdzɔe, mikpɔ nublanui, eye mianyo dɔ me na mia nɔewo. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10"/>Migate ahosiwo alo tsyɔ̃eviwo, amedzrowo alo ame dahewo ɖe anyi o. Migaɖo nu vɔ̃ɖi wɔwɔ ɖe mia nɔewo ŋu o.’<verse eid="ZEC 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11"/>“Mia fofowo gbe toɖoɖo gbedeasi sia, wolia ʋume kpakoo, eye wotsɔ asibidɛ xe to me be yewomagase nye nya la o. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12"/>Wona woƒe dziwo sẽ abe hlihãkpe ene, elabena womedi be yewoase nye Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la ƒe nyawo kple se siwo metsɔ na wo to nye Yehowa ƒe Gbɔgbɔ kple nyagblɔɖila siwo nɔ anyi tsã la dzi o. Esia ta nye Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la, medo dɔmedzoe ɖe wo ŋuti ɖo.<verse eid="ZEC 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13"/>“ ‘Meyɔ wo, gake wogbe tɔtɔ, eya ta esi wodo ɣli yɔm la, nye hã metrɔ megbe de wo,’ Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14"/>‘Mekaka wo kple yali ɖe dukɔwo katã dome, afi si wozu amedzrowo le. Woƒe anyigba si wogblẽ ɖe megbea la zu aƒedo, afi si ame aɖeke mate ŋu ayi o. Aleae wowɔ anyigba nyui la wòzu gbegbe nye esi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa do ŋugbe be yeayra Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1"/>Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la ƒe gbedeasi gava nam be,<verse eid="ZEC 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2"/>Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔ be, “Meʋã ŋu ɖe Zion nu vevie, eye medo dɔmedzoe, ʋã ŋu ɖe enu vevie.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3"/>Ale Yehowa gblɔe nye esi: “Matrɔ ayi Zion, eye manɔ Yerusalem, ekema woayɔ Yerusalem be Nyateƒedu, eye woayɔ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la, ƒe to la be, To Kɔkɔe.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4"/>Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔ be, “Ŋutifafa kple dzidzeme agava Yerusalem hena ƒe geɖewo, ale be woagakpɔ amegãɖeɖiwo kple nyagãɖeɖiwo woalé kpo ɖe asi, anɔ zɔzɔm ɖɔɖɔɖɔ le ablɔ dzi abe tsã ene. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5"/>Duwo ƒe mɔtatawo dzi ayɔ fũu kple ɖekakpuiwo kple ɖetugbiwo eye woanɔ fefem kple dzidzɔ.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6"/>Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔ be, “Ɣe ma ɣi la, adze nu si wɔ nuku na ame ʋɛ siwo susɔ, ke nye ya la, ɖe wòawɔ nuku nama?”<verse eid="ZEC 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, “Maɖe nye amewo tso dukɔ siwo le ɣedzeƒe kple ɣetoɖoƒe la ƒe asi me. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8"/>Makplɔ wo agbɔe be woava nɔ Yerusalem. Woanye nye amewo, eye manye woƒe Mawu le nyateƒe kple dzɔdzɔenyenye me.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, “Mi ame siwo le nya siwo nyagblɔɖilawo gblɔ da ɖi la sem, ame siwo nɔ anyi hafi woɖo Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la ƒe gbedoxɔ la gɔme anyi, mido ŋusẽ nu be miawu gbedoxɔ la tutu nu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10"/>Hafi ɣe ma ɣi naɖo la, womexea fe na amewo alo lãwo o. Ame aɖeke mate ŋu ado go, ayi eƒe dɔwɔƒe le dedinɔnɔ me o ɖe eƒe futɔwo ta, elabena mena ame sia ame tso ɖe ehavi ŋuti. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11"/>Ke azɔ la, nyemawɔ na ame siwo susɔ la abe ale si mewɔ na amewo va yi ene o.” Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12"/>“Atiku la amie, atsi, wainkawo atse nyuie, anyigba aʋã eƒe nukuwo, eye ahũ adza tso dziƒo. Matsɔ nu siawo katã ana nye ame siwo susɔ la abe woƒe domenyinu ene. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13"/>Esi mienye ɖiŋudonu le dukɔwo dome ta la, O! Yuda kple Israel, maɖe mi, eye mianye yayra. Migavɔ̃ o, mido ŋusẽ miaƒe alɔwo.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: “Abe ale si meɖoe kplikpaa be mahe tsɔtsrɔ̃ va mia dzii, eye nyemakpɔ nublanui o, esi mia fofowo do dɔmedzoe nam ene la,” Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15"/>“nenema azɔ, meɖoe kplikpaa be magawɔ nyui na Yerusalem kple Yuda, eya ta migavɔ̃ o. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16"/>Esiawoe nye nu siwo miawɔ: mito nyateƒe na mia haviwo, mitso afia si le eteƒe, eye wòle dzɔdzɔe la le miaƒe ʋɔnuwo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17"/>Mègaɖo vɔ̃ ɖe hawòvi ŋuti o, eye atam dzodzro kaka megado dzidzɔ na wò o, elabena metsri nu siawo.” Yehowae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18"/>Esia hã nye gbedeasi bubu si va nam tso Yehowa Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gbɔ:<verse eid="ZEC 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: “Nutsitsidɔ siwo miewɔna le ɣleti enelia, atɔ̃lia, adrelia kple ewolia me la, anye dzidzɔ kple aseyetsotso ƒe azãwo na Yuda, eya ta milɔ̃ nyateƒe kple ŋutifafa.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi, “Ame geɖewo kple ame siwo tso du geɖewo me le mɔ dzi gbɔna, <verse eid="ZEC 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21"/>eye amewo atso du ɖeka me ayi du bubu me ahagblɔ be, ‘Mina míatso zi ɖeka, míayi aɖaɖe kuku na Yehowa, eye míadi Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la. Nye la, medze mɔ yina.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22"/>Ale amewo kple dukɔ siwo ŋu ŋusẽ le la ava Yerusalem be yewoadi Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la, eye woaƒo koko nɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23"/>Ale Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la gblɔe nye esi: “Le ŋkeke mawo me la, ŋutsu ewo atso gbegbɔgblɔwo kple dukɔ bubuwo me alé Yudatɔ ɖeka ƒe awu to ahagblɔ be, ‘Na míayi kpli wò, elabena míese be Mawu li kpli mi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ʋɔnudɔdrɔ̃ Israel ƒe futɔwo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1"/>Yehowa ƒe nya tsi tsitre ɖe Hadraknyigba ŋu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">eye ava Damasko hã dzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">elabena Yehowa ƒe ŋku le amewo kple Israel ƒe toawo katã ŋu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2"/>Ava Hamat si ƒo xlãe la hã dzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">eye ava Tiro kple Sidon hã dzi togbɔ be</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">wodze aye ale gbegbe hã.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3"/>Tiro tu mɔ sesẽ na eɖokui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">eli kɔ klosalo abe ʋuʋudedi ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:3">eye nenema ke sika bɔ abe ke si</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">le mɔdodo dzi ene.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4"/>Ke Yehowa axɔ kesinɔnuwo le esi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">akaka eƒe tɔdziʋuwo kple wo me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">nɔlawo ƒe ŋusẽ, eye dzo ava fiae ƒioƒioƒio.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5"/>Askelon akpɔe, eye vɔvɔ̃ aɖoe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza aŋe kple vevesese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Nenema kee nye Ekron hã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">elabena eƒe mɔkpɔkpɔ abu ɖee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Woawu Gaza fia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">eye Askelon azu aƒedo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6"/>Amedzrowo ava xɔ Asdod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">eye maɖe Filistitɔwo ƒe dada la ɖa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7"/>Maɖe ʋu ɖa le woƒe nuwo me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">kple nuɖuɖu si wotsri na wo la</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">le woƒe aɖutame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ame siwo susɔ la anye míaƒe Mawu la tɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">woazu kplɔlawo le Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">eye Ekron anɔ abe Yebusitɔwo ene.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8"/>Ke maʋli nye gbedoxɔ la ta tso adzohawo ƒe asi me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">Ŋutasẽla magaɖu nye amewo dzi akpɔ gbeɖe o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">elabena azɔ mele wo ŋu dzɔm.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zion se fia la ƒe vava</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9"/>Dzi nadzɔ wò, O Zion vinyɔnu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Do ɣli, wò Yerusalem vinyɔnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">kpɔ ɖa, wò fia gbɔna gbɔwò.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Enye dzɔdzɔetɔ, eye wòhe ɖeɖe vɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">ebɔbɔ eɖokui, eye wòle tedzi dom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">si nye tedzivi si nye tedzinɔ ƒe vi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10"/>Axɔ tasiaɖamwo le Efraim si</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">kple aʋawɔsɔwo le Yerusalem si,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">eye wòaŋe woƒe aʋawɔdatiwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Aɖe gbeƒã ŋutifafa na dukɔwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">eƒe fiaɖuƒe akeke tso ƒuta ayi ƒuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">tso tɔsisi la nu ayi anyigba ƒe seƒewo ke.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11"/>Ɖe nu si mebla kpli wò,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">tre enu kple ʋu ta la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">maɖe wò tso ku me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">be màgaku ɖe do globo ƒuƒui la me o.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12"/>Mitrɔ yi ɖe miaƒe mɔ sesẽwo me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">O, mi gamenɔla siwo si mɔkpɔkpɔ le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">Ke azɔ la, mele gbeƒã ɖem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">na mi be magbugbɔ aɖo nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">siwo miebu la teƒe na mi zi eve.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13"/>Mabɔ Yuda abe ale si mebɔa nye da ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">eye matsɔ Efraim awɔ datii ayɔ eme fũu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">O Zion, manyɔ viwò ŋutsuwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">ɖe Griktɔwo ŋu, eye mawɔ wò abe aʋawɔla ƒe yi ene.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa ava do</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14"/>Yehowa ava do ɖe wo dzi kpoyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">eye eƒe aŋutrɔwo anɔ bibim abe dzikedzo ene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Aƒetɔ Yehowa aku kpẽ azɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">le anyigbeme ƒe ahomwo me,<verse eid="ZEC 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15"/>eye Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Mawu la</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">atsɔ akpoxɔnu atsyɔ wo dzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Woagblẽ nu, eye woatsɔ kpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">ade aŋetu me atsɔ aɖu wo dzii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Woano woawo ŋutɔ ƒe ʋu abe wain ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">wòayɔ woƒe ƒodo fũu abe agba ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">eye wòaƒo wo bekee abe ale si</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">wokɔa wain ɖe vɔsamlekpui ƒe dzogoewo dzi ene.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16"/>Yehowa, woƒe Mawu la</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">aɖe wo gbe ma gbe abe ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">siwo nye eƒe alẽhawo ene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Woaklẽ le eƒe anyigba la dzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">abe adzagba le fiakuku ŋu ene.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17"/>Aleke woahanyo eye woahadze anii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Bli ana ɖekakpuiawo natsi nyuie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">eye wain yeye ana ɖetugbiawo hã natsi nyuie.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa akpɔ Yuda ta</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1"/>Mibia Yehowa wòana tsi nadza na mi le tsidzaɣi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">elabena Yehowae nana tsi ɖona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Enana tsi dzana na amewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">eye wònana nukuwo miena ɖe bo dzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">na ame sia ame.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2"/>Legbawo blea ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">bokɔnɔwo kpɔa ŋutega</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">siwo mele eteƒe o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">wokua drɔ̃e siwo nye aʋatso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">eye wogblɔa akɔfanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">siwo mevaa eme o.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Eya ta ameawo le tsaglalã tsam abe alẽ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">siwo wote ɖe anyi la ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">elabena kplɔla mele wo si o.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3"/>“Nye dɔmedzoe bi ɖe alẽkplɔlawo ŋu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">eye mahe to na kplɔlawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">elabena Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la akpɔ Yuda ƒe aƒe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">eƒe alẽha la ta, eye wòawɔ wo woanɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">abe sɔ si ŋu ŋusẽ le le aʋagbedzi ene.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4"/>Dzogoedzikpe atso Yuda ava, eye tsyoti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">dati siwo ŋu dɔ wowɔna le aʋa me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">kple dziɖula ɖe sia ɖe atso Yuda ava.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5"/>Wo katã woabɔ asaɖa abe ŋutsu kalẽtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">siwo le zɔzɔm le bamɔtatawo dzi le aʋagbedzi ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">elabena Yehowa li kpli wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">woawɔ aʋa, aɖu sɔdolawo dzi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6"/>“Mado ŋusẽ Yuda ƒe aƒe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">eye maɖe Yosef ƒe aƒe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">magbugbɔ wo agaɖo te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">elabena mekpɔ nublanui na wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Woanɔ abe ɖe nyemegbe nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">le wo gbɔ kpɔ o ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">elabena nyee nye Yehowa, woƒe Mawu la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">eye matɔ na wo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7"/>Efraimtɔwo ava nɔ abe ŋutsu kalẽtɔwo ene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">eye woƒe dziwo akpɔ dzidzɔ abe wain wono ene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Wo viwo akpɔe, woatso aseye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">eye woakpɔ dzidzɔ ɖe Yehowa ŋu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8"/>Mana dzesi wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">eye maƒo wo nu ƒu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">maɖe wo vavã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">eye woagasɔ gbɔ abe tsã ene.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9"/>Togbɔ be mekaka wo ɖe amewo dome hã la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">woaɖo ŋku dzinye le anyigba didi mawo dzi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Wo kple wo viwo atsi agbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">eye woagatrɔ agbɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10"/>Makplɔ wo agbɔe tso Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">eye maƒo wo nu ƒu tso Asiria;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">makplɔ wo va Gilead kple Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">eye womakpɔ teƒe anɔ gɔ̃ hã o.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11"/>Woato nuxaxa ƒe atsiaƒu me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">ke woaɖu ƒu dzeagbowo dzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">eye Nil tɔsisi ƒe gogloƒewo aƒu kplakplakpla.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Woaŋe kɔ le Asiria ƒe dada nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">eye woaɖe Egipte ƒe fiatikplɔ ɖa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12"/>Mado ŋusẽ wo le Yehowa me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">eye eƒe ŋkɔ me woazɔ le.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">Yehowae gblɔe.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1"/>“O Lebanon, ʋu wò agbowo da ɖi siaa be</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">dzo nabi wò sedatiwo!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2"/>Mifa avi, O logotiwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">elabena sedati mu dze anyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">ati gãwo tsrɔ̃!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Mi ati sesẽ siwo le Basan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">mifa avi, elabena wolã avetsuawo ƒu anyi!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3"/>Miɖo to alẽkplɔlawo ƒe avifafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">elabena woƒe lãnyiƒe damawo tsrɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Miɖo to dzatawo ƒe xɔxlɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">elabena Yɔdan ƒe ave damawo tsrɔ̃!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Alẽkplɔlawo ƒe ha eveawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4"/>Yehowa, nye Mawu la gblɔ nam be, “Yi nàwɔ dɔ abe alẽkplɔla ene, eye nàkplɔ alẽ siwo woɖo ɖi na wuwu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5"/>Wo ƒlelawo wua wo yakatsyɔ, eye ame aɖeke mehea to na wo o. Ame siwo dzra wo la hã gblɔ be, ‘Mikafu Yehowa elabena mezu kesinɔtɔ!’ Woƒe kplɔlawo ŋutɔ gɔ̃ hã mekpɔa wo ta o, <verse eid="ZEC 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6"/>elabena nyemagakpɔ nublanui na anyigbadzinɔlawo o.” Yehowae gblɔe. “Malé ame sia ame ade asi na ehavi kple eƒe fia. Woate anyigba la ɖe to, eye nyemaɖe wo tso woƒe asi me o.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7"/>Ale nye ŋutɔ mekplɔ alẽha si woɖo ɖi na wuwu, vevietɔ wo dometɔ siwo wote ɖe anyi. Metsɔ atizɔti eve, meyɔ ɖeka be Dɔmefafa, evelia be Ɖekawɔwɔ, eye mekpɔ alẽha la ta. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8"/>Le ɣleti ɖeka me la, meɖe alẽkplɔla etɔ̃ katã ɖa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 11:8">Alẽha la lé fum, eye woƒe nu ti kɔ nam. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9"/>Megblɔ be, “Nyemaganye miaƒe kplɔla o. Ame siwo le kukum la neku, eye ame siwo le tsɔtsrɔ̃m la netsrɔ̃. Ame siwo susɔ la nelé wo nɔewo ɖu.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10"/>Ale metsɔ nye atikplɔ si meyɔ be Dɔmefafa la, meŋee, eye metu nu si mebla kple dukɔwo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11"/>Metu nubabla la gbe ma gbe, eye ame siwo nu ti kɔ na le alẽhawo me, esi wole kpɔyem la, nyae be enye Yehowa ƒe nya.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12"/>Megblɔ na wo be, “Ne edze mia ŋu la, ekema mixe nye fe nam, gake ne medze mia ŋu o la, mitsɔe.” Ale woxe klosaloga blaetɔ̃ nam.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13"/>Yehowa gblɔ nam be, “Tsɔe ƒu gbe ɖe zemela ŋu.” Eyae nye home gã si wosusu be mexɔ! Ale metsɔ klosaloga blaetɔ̃ la ƒu gbe ɖe Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ ƒe nudzraɖoƒe.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14"/>Azɔ meŋe nye atikplɔ evelia si meyɔ be Ɖekawɔwɔ la, ale meŋe ɖekawɔwɔ si le Yuda kple Israel dome.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15"/>Yehowa gblɔ nam be, “Tsɔ alẽkplɔla tsibome ƒe lãkplɔnu, <verse eid="ZEC 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16"/>elabena mele alẽkplɔla aɖe ɖo ge ɖe anyigba la nu si makpɔ alẽ bubuwo ta alo adi alẽviwo alo abla abi na esiwo xɔ abi alo adi nuɖuɖu na esiwo le sesĩe la o, ke boŋ aɖu alẽ nyuitɔwo ƒe lã, eye wòavuvu woƒe afɔkliwo.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17"/>“Baba na alẽkplɔla ɖigbɔ̃ la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">ame si gblẽ alẽha la ɖi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Yi nelã eƒe abɔ, eye wòaho eƒe ɖusimeŋku!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">Eƒe abɔ nedzo ɖo agu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">eye eƒe ɖusimeŋku nagbã keŋkeŋ!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Woatsrɔ̃ Yerusalem ƒe futɔwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1"/>Esiae nye Yehowa ƒe nya si wògblɔ ɖe Israel ŋu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 12:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">Yehowa si wɔ dziƒo kple anyigba, eye wòwɔ gbɔgbɔ de ame me, eyae gblɔ be, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2"/>“Mawɔ Yerusalem wòanye kplu si ne ame siwo ƒo xlãe noe la, woamu. Woaɖe to ɖe Yuda kple Yerusalem. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3"/>Gbe ma gbe ne dukɔ siwo katã le anyigba dzi ƒo ƒu ɖe eŋuti la, mawɔ Yerusalem wòanye agakpe si meʋãna o la na dukɔwo. Ame siwo katã adi be yewoamli agakpe sia la axɔ abi. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4"/>Gbe ma gbe la, made vɔvɔ̃ sɔ ɖe sia ɖe me, eye matsɔ tsukuku ada ɖe wo dolawo dzi.” Yehowae gblɔe. “Nye ŋkuwo anɔ Yuda ƒe aƒe la ŋuti ɖaa, ke magbã ŋku na dukɔwo ƒe sɔwo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5"/>Ekema Yuda ƒe kplɔlawo agblɔ le woƒe dzi me be, ‘Yerusalemtɔwo sesẽ, elabena Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae nye woƒe Mawu.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6"/>“Gbe ma gbe la, mawɔ Yuda ƒe kplɔlawo woanɔ abe dzoɖenu le nake si woƒo kɔe la dzi ene. Woanɔ abe akakati bibi le gbe ƒuƒuwo dome ene. Woabi ame siwo ƒo xlã wo, ɖusime kple miame siaa, ke Yerusalem ya anɔ te sesĩe.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7"/>“Yehowa aɖe Yuda ƒe nɔƒewo gbã, ale be bubu si le David ƒe aƒe la kple Yerusalem me nɔlawo ŋu la malolo wu Yudatɔ o. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8"/>Gbe ma gbe la, Yehowa atsɔ akpoxɔnu atsyɔ Yerusalem nɔlawo dzi, ale be ame gblɔetɔ kekeake si le wo dome la anɔ abe David ene, eye David ƒe aƒe la anɔ abe Mawu ene, anɔ abe Yehowa ƒe dɔla si dze ŋgɔ na wo la ene. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9"/>Gbe ma gbe la, matsrɔ̃ dukɔ siwo katã tso ɖe Yerusalem ŋu.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Konyifafa le ame si wotɔ nui la ŋu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10"/>“Makɔ amenuveve kple gbedodoɖa ƒe gbɔgbɔ ɖe David ƒe aƒe la kple Yerusalem nɔlawo dzi. Woakpɔ nye, ame si wotɔ nui la dzi, woafa nɛ abe ale si wofana na vi ɖeka hɔ̃ɔ si ku la ene, eye woafa nɛ vevie abe ŋgɔgbevi si ku la ene. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11"/>Gbe ma gbe la, avi aɖi hoo le Yerusalem abe ale si Hadad Rimon fa avi vevie le Megido ƒe balime ene. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12"/>Anyigba la katã afa avi; to ɖe sia ɖe afa avi na eɖokui, eye wo srɔ̃wo anɔ wo gbɔ: to si tso David ƒe aƒe me kple wo srɔ̃wo, to si tso Natan ƒe aƒe me kple wo srɔ̃wo, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13"/>to si tso Levi ƒe aƒe me kple wo srɔ̃wo, Simei ƒe to kple wo srɔ̃wo, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14"/>eye to mamlɛawo katã hã kple wo srɔ̃wo.”<verse eid="ZEC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ŋutikɔklɔ tso nu vɔ̃ me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1"/>“Gbe ma gbe la, vudo aʋu na David ƒe aƒe la kple Yerusalem nɔlawo be woaklɔ wo ŋuti tso vɔ̃ kple ɖiƒoƒowo katã me.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2"/>“Gbe ma gbe la, maɖe legbawo katã ƒe ŋkɔ ɖa le anyigba la dzi, eye womagaɖo ŋku wo dzi akpɔ gbeɖe o.” Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe. “Maɖe nyagblɔɖilawo kple makɔmakɔnyenye ƒe gbɔgbɔ ɖa le anyigba la dzi. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3"/>Ne ame aɖe aganɔ nya gblɔm ɖi la, fofoa kple dadaa, ame siwo dzii la agblɔ nɛ be, ‘Èdze na ku, elabena ègblɔ aʋatsonyawo le Yehowa ƒe ŋkɔ me.’ Ke ne egblɔ nya ɖi la, edzilawo ŋutɔ atɔ hɛe wòaku.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4"/>“Gbe ma gbe la, nyagblɔɖila ɖe sia ɖe ƒe ŋutega si wòakpɔ la akpe ŋu nɛ. Magado nyagblɔɖilawo ƒe awu si wowɔ kple ɖa la be wòable amewo o. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5"/>Agblɔ be, ‘Menye nyagblɔɖilae menye o: agbledelae menye. Tso nye ɖekakpuime ke, mekpɔa nye nuɖuɖu tso anyigba me.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6"/>Ne ame aɖe abiae be, ‘Nu ka ƒe abiwoe nye esiwo le ŋutiwò?’ la, aɖo eŋu be, ‘Mexɔ abi siawo le xɔ̃nyewo ƒe aƒe me!’<verse eid="ZEC 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woƒo alẽkplɔla, alẽawo kaka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7"/>“O yi, nyɔ, nàtso ɖe nye alẽkplɔla la ŋu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ɖe ame si tsɔ ɖe gbɔnye kpokploe la ŋu!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Xlã nu ɖe alẽkplɔla la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">alẽawo aka ahlẽ, eye matrɔ nye asi ɖe suetɔwo ŋu<verse eid="ZEC 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8"/>le anyigba blibo la dzi.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ lae gblɔe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:8">“Woaxlã nu ɖe akpa etɔ̃awo ƒe eve woaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">eye akpa etɔ̃awo ƒe ɖeka atsi afi ma.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9"/>Etɔ̃liawo ƒe ɖeka sia matsɔ ade dzo me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">maklɔ wo ŋuti abe ale si woklɔa klosaloe ene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">eye mado wo kpɔ abe ale si</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">wodoa sika kpɔ ene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Woayɔ nye ŋkɔ, eye matɔ na wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Magblɔ be,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">‘Wonye nye amewo’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Woawo hã agblɔ be,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">‘Yehowae nye míaƒe Mawu.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yehowa, va nàɖu fia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1"/>Yehowa ƒe ŋkeke gbɔna esi woama wò nuhahawo na mi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2"/>Maƒo dukɔwo katã nu ƒu be woava awɔ avu kple Yerusalem, woaxɔ du la, woalɔ aƒewo katã ƒioƒioƒio, eye woalé nyɔnuwo sesẽtɔe adɔ kpli wo. Woakplɔ du la ƒe afã ayi aboyo mee, gake ame mamlɛawo atsi dua me. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3"/>Ekema Yehowa ado, awɔ aʋa kple dukɔ siawo abe ale si wòwɔa aʋae le aʋagbedzi ene. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4"/>Gbe ma gbe la, atsi tsitre ɖe Amito si le Yerusalem ƒe ɣedzeƒe la dzi, eye Amito la ama ɖe eve kpla, ɖeka ayi ɣedzeƒe, evelia ayi ɣetoɖoƒe. Bali gã aɖe anɔ wo dome ale be to la ƒe afã ayi anyiehe, eye afã ayi dziehe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5"/>Miasi ato nye to la ƒe balime, elabena akeke va se ɖe keke Azel. Miasi abe ale si miesi le Yuda fia Uzia ƒe ŋkekewo me esime anyigba ʋuʋu la ene. Ekema Yehowa, nye Mawu la ava, eye kɔkɔetɔwo katã anɔ eŋu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6"/>Gbe ma gbe la, akaɖi, vuvɔ alo afu manɔ anyi o. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7"/>Anye ŋkeke tɔxɛ, elabena ŋkeke alo zã manɔ anyi o. Yehowa koe nya ŋkeke sia. Ne zã do la, kekeli ava.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8"/>Gbe ma gbe la, agbetsi asi tso Yerusalem, afã asi ayi ɖe ɣedzeƒeƒu la me, eye afã asi ayi ɣetoɖoƒeƒu la me. Anɔ alea le dzomeŋɔli kple vuvɔŋɔli siaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9"/>Yehowa aɖu fia ɖe anyigba blibo la dzi. Gbe ma gbe la, Yehowa ɖeka koe anɔ anyi, eye eya ko ƒe ŋkɔe anɔ anyi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10"/>Anyigba blibo la, tso Geba yi Rimon le Yerusalem ƒe dziehe, anɔ abe Araba ene. Ke woakɔ Yerusalem ɖe dzi, eye wòanɔ eteƒe tso Benyamingbo la nu yi ɖe Agbo Gbãtɔ nu, yi ɖe Dzogoegbo la nu, eye tso Hananel ƒe Gbetakpɔxɔ gbɔ va se ɖe fiawo ƒe wainfiaƒe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11"/>Amewo anɔ eme, eye womagagbãe azɔ o. Dedinɔnɔ anɔ Yerusalem ɖaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12"/>Esiae nye dɔvɔ̃ si Yehowa akplɔ aƒu dukɔ siwo katã wɔ avu kple Yerusalem: woƒe ŋutilãwo aƒaƒã le esime wogale afɔ dzi le yiyim. Woƒe ŋkuwo avo ɖe tome na wo, eye woƒe aɖewo aƒaƒã ɖe nu me na wo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13"/>Gbe ma gbe la, Yehowa atsɔ ŋɔdzi aƒo ŋutsuwoe; ŋutsu ɖe sia ɖe aku ɖe nɔvia ƒe asi ŋu, eye woawɔ avu kple wo nɔewo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14"/>Yuda hã awɔ avu le Yerusalem; woaƒo dukɔ siwo katã ƒo xlã wo la ƒe kesinɔnuwo nu ƒu, sika kple klosalo gbogbo aɖe kple nudodowo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15"/>Dɔvɔ̃ sia tɔgbi adze sɔwo, lãɖisɔwo, kposɔwo, tedziwo kple lã siwo katã le woƒe asaɖawo me la dzi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16"/>Ame siwo katã tsi agbe tso dukɔ siwo wɔ avu kple Yerusalem me la ayi aɖasubɔ Fia si nye Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la, ƒe sia ƒe, eye woaɖu Agbadɔmeŋkekenyuiwo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17"/>Ne ame siwo le anyigba la dzi dometɔ aɖe meyi ɖe Yerusalem ɖasubɔ Fia si nye Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la o la, tsi madza na wo o. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18"/>Ne Egiptetɔwo meyi ɖakpɔ gome le eme o la, tsi madza na wo o. Yehowa aƒo wo kple dɔvɔ̃ siwo wòtsɔ ƒo dukɔ siwo meyi ɖe Agbadɔmeŋkekenyuiɖuƒe o. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19"/>Esia anye Egipte kple dukɔ bubu siwo meyi Agbadɔmeŋkekenyuiɖuƒe o la ƒe tohehe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20"/>Gbe ma gbe la, woaŋlɔ ɖe gavi siwo wode kɔ na sɔwo la dzi be, “<char style="sc">Èle kɔkɔe na Yehowa</char>,” eye nuɖaze siwo le Yehowa ƒe gbedoxɔ me la anɔ abe agba kɔkɔe siwo le vɔsamlekpui la ƒe ŋkume ene. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21"/>Nuɖaze ɖe sia ɖe si le Yerusalem kple Yuda la anɔ kɔkɔe na Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la, eye ame siwo katã va vɔsaƒe la atsɔ nuɖaze aɖewo aɖa nu le wo me, eye gbe ma gbe la, Kanaantɔ aɖeke maganɔ Yehowa, Dziƒoʋakɔwo ƒe Aƒetɔ la ƒe gbedoxɔ me o.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14"/>
</usx>
